  "synopsis": "Ten years ago, after three consecutive days of blood moon, ghosts, gods, heterochromatic eyes, and strange tales arrived one after another. Mystery and enigma descended upon the human world. Terror and despair roamed the earth. As humans, should we kneel in submission, weep bitterly, or draw our swords? This is a new era, and this era—belongs to the extraordinary! Pushing open the door to the extraordinary, Su Bai encountered a new world…\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)",
